# Doc alignment trigger

If the user asks to **controllare / allineare / verificare la documentazione**, doc drift, or whether AGENTS/TODO/docs are out of date:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/doc-align/SKILL.md` (full workflow).
2. Run `python scripts/check_docs_alignment.py` first (structural).
3. Then do the semantic domain spot-check from that skill.
4. Report in the skill’s template; fix only if the user asked to fix/allinea/sistema.
